lines = ["As part of your job, you'll have to traverse underwater caverns to find enemies.", 
"Enemies could be anywhere down here, so make sure to search each cave thoroughly.", 
"The meter next to the time left represents your air.", "It'll drain as long as you're underwater, and if it empties you'll start taking damage, so make sure to keep an eye on it.",
"Air can be replenished by bubbles or by defeating an enemy.", "Air bubbles disappear after collecting them, but will replenish themselves if you surface.", 
"To surface just go to the top of the cave and press SPACE/RIGHT CLICK.", "That's about all the information I have for you.", 
"Focus on clearing all the enemies out but be conscious of your time. Just remember, you have 3 days to complete this task so there's no harm in playing it safe.", 
"I'll leave you to it now."];
i = 0;
text = lines[i];
